  },
  "profileDeletionNoticeWhatOwnReport": "One or more reports you made that have not finished being handled have been kept. Your name has been removed from them, but what you wrote is still there.",
  "@profileDeletionNoticeWhatOwnReport": {
    "description": "The WHAT line when only reports the person FILED were kept: their cases were still open, so they stay without the person's name until they close (Malin, 2026-09-18). Count-neutral, because the server does not send how many."
  },
  "profileDeletionNoticeWhatBoth": "The following has been kept: an ongoing review of content that was reported, and one or more reports you made that have not finished being handled. Your name has been removed from the reports, but what you wrote is still there.",
